      "parameters": {
        "sendTo": "YOUR_TEST_EMAIL@example.com",
        "subject": "=URGENT: High-Severity Incident - {{ $('Incident Commander').item.json.output.incident_title }}",
        "message": "=<h2>High-Severity Incident Escalation</h2><p><strong>Incident ID:</strong> {{ $('Fetch Pending Incidents').item.json['Incident ID'] }}</p><p><strong>Title:</strong> {{ $('Incident Commander').item.json.output.incident_title }}</p><p><strong>Severity:</strong> {{ $('Incident Commander').item.json.output.severity_score }}</p><p>The automated incident review classified this event as High severity. Immediate executive attention is required.</p><p><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/{{ $('Write Post-Mortem Content').item.json.documentId }}/edit\">Open the post-mortem report</a></p>",
        "options": {
