      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Escalation Logic\n\nThe IF node checks the AI field `severity_score`.\n\n- **High** → send an urgent Gmail alert to the CTO, then mark the incident as Processed.\n- **Medium or Low** → do not send an email; only mark the incident as Processed.\n\nThis reduces alert fatigue while still generating and logging a post-mortem for every pending incident.",
